{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_0_0_welcome_to_guide","groupId":"main_0","stageId":null,"title":"序章・上","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/guide/beg/0_welcome_to_guide.txt","sourceHash":"d1486a01086cbb33c733808e5af24588aeed8e5323221018403a7d8cba7811dc","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"チェルノボーグの中枢区画にある、救命用の「棺桶」で眠っていたドクターは、ある少女の声で目を覚ました。\n記憶をなくしたドクターに対し、少女はアーミヤと名乗る。そして彼女がドクターに事情を説明しようとした矢先、レユニオンという組織の人間が襲撃を仕掛けてきた。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"初始引导\nああ、君か。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_babel"},{"type":"narration","text":"随分と久しぶりじゃないか。\nどうやら、君はずっと……境界を彷徨っていたようだな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"自分が何者なのかさえ、覚えていないかもしれないが……名前だけでも思い出せるなら、それで十分だ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"――さぁ、ここに長く留まっていてはいけない。\n君は私の客人ではなく、ここにいるべき存在でもないのだから。\n彼女には君が必要なんだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"12月23日。\nこの日付が君にとってどんな意味を持っているのか――覚えてはいないかもしれない。\nだが、思い出せないままでは、君は非常に危険な状況に陥りかねないんだ。\n......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"いや、それ以前に――\n君は絶対に、思い出さなければならない。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_am"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……意識レベルが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"体外循環開始…………心筋保護液の注入、完了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……体温低下……ヘクサメタゾン20ccを静脈に注射。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"止血鉗子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……状態の安定を確認……切除を開始します。……心室細動に注意して……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……ごめんなさい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謎の声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"また、苦しめることになってしまって。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……手を……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"私の……を……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"私の手を握って！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"緊急……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……救……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……完了……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター……ドクター！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医療オペレーターさん、ドクターは大丈夫なんでしょうか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今……手を握り返してくれたと思うんです、絶対……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"なのに、まだ意識がはっきりしてないみたいで……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤさん！　あまり焦らないで、どうか落ち着いてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ……ご、ごめんなさい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"本当に、ドクターのこととなると急に慌ててしまうんですから……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"でも、アーミヤさん。もしもドクターが……目覚めなかったら、どうするつもりなんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――心の準備は、できていますから。もしそうなったら……決めていた通りにするだけです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかりました。あなたが言うなら、そうしましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……お願いします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ドクター……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"安心してください、アーミヤさん。ドクターの容態は安定していますから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"念のため、もう一度検査をしておきましょうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ありがとうございます……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"うん……確かに、呼吸は弱いですが、血圧は正常値ですね。大きな問題はないと思います。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"目を覚まされましたか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"よかった……！　アーミヤさん、うまくいったみたいですね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……ドクター……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"よかった……本当に、よかったです……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、危ない！　無理に動かないでください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"どうか安静に……まだ本調子ではないわけですし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうしたんですか……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"君たちは、誰だ……？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ……？　ドクター、私――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私の名前は、アーミヤといいます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちは……あなたを助けに来たんです。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……「あなた」……というのは……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……目の前にいる、あなたのことですよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我々と同じ「ロドス」の一員で……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私の同僚でもある――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたは、私の一番大切な仲間なんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……思い出せませんか？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……本当に、信じていいのか？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そうですよね。いきなりこんなことを言われても、受け入れがたいだろうと思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私も、すぐにすべてを思い出せるとは思っていませんし、今すぐ信頼してほしいとは言いません。"}]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかして、Dr.{@nickname}は私のことも忘れてしまったんでしょうか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だとしても……私は諦めません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたを見つけ出すために、多くの代償を支払ってきましたから……"}]},{"label":"そうか……初めまして、アーミヤ。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あ……は、初めまして。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃなくて、ええと……！　すみません、なんと言えばいいのやら……色々なことが、前とは変わってしまいましたし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私自身、変化はありましたから……"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ですが、とにかく……私にとって、ドクターは一番大切な人なんです。どんなことがあっても、それだけは変わりません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ですので、少しだけ……私に、時間をもらえませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ほんの少しだけで構いませんから……"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターは……本当に、記憶喪失になってしまったんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今は、これでいいんだと思います。ドクターを負担から遠ざけることもできるかもしれませんし。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"ところで、ここは一体……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この場所は――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？　今のは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"完全武装の男","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤさん、大変です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"完全武装の男","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"誰かが施設に侵入してきたみたいで……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"完全武装の男","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"あの服装……ウルサス兵じゃありませんね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"完全武装の男","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"お前ら、いきなり何のつもりだ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"完全武装の男","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"撃ってきやがった……！　みなさん、敵襲です！　――あいつら重火力兵器を持ってますよ、アーミヤさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"あわわわ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、どうかお気をつけて！　遮蔽物を利用しつつ、ドクターを守りましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、あの服装はまさか……レユニオン？　どうして彼らが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――いえ。それよりまずは……前衛オペレーターさん、戦闘の準備をお願いします！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"にしても、こいつら……まさか、ドクターを狙ってるのか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"いえ……ドクターの存在は、誰にも知られていないはずです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ひとまず、ケルシー先生に連絡を取ることはできますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"それが、なぜか通信しても応答がないんです……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうやら、通信が妨害されているようですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ウルサス政府に、我々の位置を気取られたんでしょうか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"弱ったな……どうしますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"本作戦の指揮官はケルシー先生ですが、この状況では指揮を執ることができませんし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……となれば……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちの指揮を、お願いできませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"き、危険すぎませんか……？　ドクターは意識が戻ったばかりですし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……試して、みたいんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"確かに記憶を失ってはいますが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ドクターは、我々と共に戦い続けてきた人ですから。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"たくさんのことを教えてくれて、ありがとうございます……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちは、多くのことを一緒に乗り越えてきたんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だから、わかるんです……ドクターなら、きっと勝利をもたらしてくれるって。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたなら、きっと勝利をもたらしてくれますから。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……急にこんなことをお願いするなんて、無茶な話とは思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……どうか、お願いです。私たちを助けてもらえませんか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私も、お手伝いしますから！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"それなら、まずはこの連中を片付けよう！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"身を護るには反撃あるのみだ。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私も、ドクターをまた、こんな争いに巻き込みたくはないのですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今の私たちには、Dr.{@nickname}の知恵が必要なんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"戦いの中で、以前の感覚を取り戻すことができたら、というのもありますし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――もしかすると、ドクター自身、自分を信じることができないかもしれませんが……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は、あなたを信じます。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――あなたならできると、信じています。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ですから――ロドスの指揮をお願いします、ドクター！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["？？？","アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター","完全武装の男"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]}]}
